<head><title>Namespaces and malformed end tags</title></head>
<body>
<svg width="100%" viewBox="0 0 10 10">
<g transform="translate(foo)"><path d="M0 0 L10 10 Z" fill="url(#x)">
<foreignObject><div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>inside svg</div></foreignObject>
</g></svg>
<math><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&InvisibleTimes;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>0</mn></mfrac></mrow></math>
<p><a href="x"><b><i>broken</a></b></i>
</p/>
